{
    "title": "OSM 24/25 Soccer Manager Game",
    "description": "Manage your favorite football team in this brand new season of Online Soccer Manager, the ultimate free-to-play football game featuring real leagues, clubs, and players worldwide.\r\n\r\nKickstart your football manager career by signing with your favorite club, whether it's in Serie A, Premier League, Primera Division, or any global league. Take charge of renowned clubs like Real Madrid, FC Barcelona, or Liverpool FC.\r\n\r\nFrom that point on, you're the coach! Control your team's formation, line-up, and tactics. Be in command of player transfers, scouting, training, and stadium expansion to ensure your soccer team excels and meets club objectives.\r\n\r\nPlay alongside friends in the same league, reveling in the thrill of friendly competition in this engaging soccer game.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n\r\n- OSM boasts real football leagues, clubs, and players worldwide for an authentic soccer gaming experience. Play with clubs like FC Barcelona, AC Milan or Liverpool FC in this mobile manager game.\r\n- Design your ideal formation and line-up.\r\n- Utilize a diverse set of tactics for your team.\r\n- Manage player transfers with the sophisticated transfer list.\r\n- Scout talents or proven superstars to enhance your team.\r\n- Train and improve your players' skills.\r\n- Engage in unlimited friendly matches to refine tactics and boost player performance.\r\n- Expand your stadium for increased revenue and better facilities.\r\n- Experience exciting match simulations with the Match Experience feature.\r\n- Showcase your soccer manager skills globally by completing the World Map.\r\n- Compete with friends in the same league and establish dominance.\r\n- Play thrilling football games against managers worldwide, aiming to become a superstar. Join over 50 million players globally!\r\n- OSM is available in 30 different languages.\r\n\r\nNote: This game includes optional in-game purchases (includes random items). Refer to our Terms of Service and Privacy Policy for details.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Manage your favorite football team in this brand new season of Online Soccer Manager, the ultimate free-to-play football game featuring real leagues, clubs, and players worldwide.<br><br>Kickstart your football manager career by signing with your favorite club, whether it&#39;s in Serie A, Premier League, Primera Division, or any global league. Take charge of renowned clubs like Real Madrid, FC Barcelona, or Liverpool FC.<br><br>From that point on, you&#39;re the coach! Control your team&#39;s formation, line-up, and tactics. Be in command of player transfers, scouting, training, and stadium expansion to ensure your soccer team excels and meets club objectives.<br><br>Play alongside friends in the same league, reveling in the thrill of friendly competition in this engaging soccer game.<br><br>Key Features:<br><br>- OSM boasts real football leagues, clubs, and players worldwide for an authentic soccer gaming experience. Play with clubs like FC Barcelona, AC Milan or Liverpool FC in this mobile manager game.<br>- Design your ideal formation and line-up.<br>- Utilize a diverse set of tactics for your team.<br>- Manage player transfers with the sophisticated transfer list.<br>- Scout talents or proven superstars to enhance your team.<br>- Train and improve your players&#39; skills.<br>- Engage in unlimited friendly matches to refine tactics and boost player performance.<br>- Expand your stadium for increased revenue and better facilities.<br>- Experience exciting match simulations with the Match Experience feature.<br>- Showcase your soccer manager skills globally by completing the World Map.<br>- Compete with friends in the same league and establish dominance.<br>- Play thrilling football games against managers worldwide, aiming to become a superstar. Join over 50 million players globally!<br>- OSM is available in 30 different languages.<br><br>Note: This game includes optional in-game purchases (includes random items). Refer to our Terms of Service and Privacy Policy for details.",
